      "cooked": "<p>So... how exactly does Absolute Zero's Coolant Blast work?</p>\n<p>I'm playing a team game. Arsonator hits Absolute Zero for 2 points of fire damage, yet on AZ's turn, the card says he hasn't sustained any fire damage since the end of his last turn.</p>\n<p>Huh? He just took two points of fire damage.</p>\n<p>Does Coolant Blast only work when Isothermal Transducer is up?</p>",
