      "created_at": "2020-06-15T16:31:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If this is the first round then this ruling from fireside chats is what applies</p>\n<p>\n&gt; <br>\n&gt; &nbsp;</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>Supersonic Response does no extra damage on Tachyon's first turn, since she hasn't had a \"last turn.\" The same applies to Coolant Blast.</p>\n&gt; \n&gt; <p>\n</p>",
