      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-16T00:32:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No, he still had a turn, he just didn't do anything on it besides the effect which destroys the card.</p>\n<p>It's the same as when you use one of Setting Sun Ra's incapacitated powers that removes him from the game. You no longer have any effects to perform during his turn, but he still has one, as indicated by the digital game focusing in on his empty frame for a moment.</p>",
